Notes:
- The migration depends on the existing `users` and `wardrobe_items` tables, which must have been created by earlier migrations (V1 to V24). Flyway will fail on this migration if either is missing.
- `packing_list_items.item_id` uses `ON DELETE SET NULL`, so deleting a wardrobe item keeps the packing entry and falls back to `custom_name`.
